{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat legs_log.md\nsed -n '1,30p' solve.py\"","aggregated_output":"# Leg-library debrief log\n\nRecurring composition patterns and repeated novelty.\n\n## tn36 level 1\n\nAdded `clear_binary_program`: sample independent binary controls, click lit\nsegments, then execute. Dense progress is the remaining lit-segment count.\nThe ten controls are at x=21,26,31,36,41, y=42 and45. Initial lit segments\nare x=26,36,41 on both rows. Clearing these six and clicking (36,55) wins.\nVerified by `python gkm_try.py`: levels=1, moves=7, replay_ok=True.\nThe player only composes the reusable leg.\n\nClone branches gave misleading intermediate pawn positions. Those observations\nwere discarded as planning evidence; the final seven-click path was reproduced\non a fresh real entry and independently replay-validated. The earlier five-click\ncandidate failed and must not be adopted.\nimport players\n\ndef solve(env):\n    # dispatch to the per-level player for the current level, in a loop\n    while not env.terminal():\n        k = env.levels_completed + 1\n        fn = getattr(players, f'play_level_{k}', None)\n        if fn is None:\n            return\n        before = env.levels_completed\n        fn(env)\n        if env.levels_completed <= before:\n            return  # no progress -> stop\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > probe_isolation.py <<'PY'\nimport gkm_try as h\nimport players\nimport numpy as np\nfrom perception import frame_delta\n\ndef probe(env):\n players.play_level_1(env);base=np.array(env.frame()).copy();a=env.clone();b=env.clone()\n for i in range(3):\n  a.step(6,21,58)\n  print('ISOLATION',i,'parent',frame_delta(base,env.frame())['count'],'b',frame_delta(base,b.frame())['count'],'new',frame_delta(base,env.clone().frame())['count'])\n for i in range(3):\n  c=env.clone();before=np.array(c.frame()).copy();c.step(6,46,58);print('SAME',i,frame_delta(before,c.frame()))\nprint(h.A.run_program('tn36',probe)[::2])\nPY\npython probe_isolation.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
